              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Not Taken Shift:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'> Assigned Shifts that are </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d70f64'>not evaluated (Shift State = No Show)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Pending Shift: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>Assigned Shifts that are </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d70f64'>pending evaluation (Shift State = Published)</run>
